<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🧮 方程解謎·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">解出方程才能過關！每題限時90秒。小心陷阱：移項錯、符號錯、忘記驗算！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔢 開始解謎 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area（寫出完整過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>在空格填上合適的數：<br/>(a) 8 + ___ = 15    (b) ___ − 7 = 9    (c) 20 − ___ = 13</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>在空格填上合適的數：<br/>(a) 6 × ___ = 42    (b) ___ ÷ 5 = 8    (c) 72 ÷ ___ = 9</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>「一個數加 7 等於 19」—— 這個「未知數」是多少？你是怎樣找出來的？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>哥哥的年齡是弟弟的 3 倍。如果弟弟今年 <strong>y</strong> 歲，用含有 <strong>y</strong> 的代數式表示哥哥的年齡。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>一個蘋果售 $a，買 5 個共需付多少元？（用代數式表示）如果 a = 4，共需付多少元？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：代數式 — 用字母代表未知數 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <strong>為甚麼用字母？</strong>當一個數量未知或會變化時，用字母（如 x, y, a, n）代表它<br/>
      ② <strong>代數式的寫法</strong>：數字 × 字母 → 數字寫前面，乘號省略。例如：5 × y 寫成 <span class="alg">5y</span><br/>
      ③ <strong>常見翻譯</strong>：「比 x 多 3」→ <span class="alg">x + 3</span>；「y 的 2 倍」→ <span class="alg">2y</span>；「n 的一半」→ <span class="f"><span class="n">n</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span><br/>
      ④ <strong>代入求值</strong>：當知道字母的數值時，代入代數式計算結果
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap引爆例題（T3：文字→代數翻譯）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">把「a 的 3 倍加 5」寫成代數式。</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake（50% 學生）</div><div class="eq">a × 3 + 5 = a8（胡亂合併）<br/>或 3 + 5a（次序顛倒）</div><div class="why">把 a 和 5 相加變成 a8，混淆了「項」的概念</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq"><span class="alg">3a + 5</span></div><div class="why">「a 的 3 倍」= 3×a = 3a，「加 5」= +5，結果是 3a + 5（不可合併！）</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「字母代表未知數，乘號省略數行先；不同字母不可加，代入求值要小心」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最高頻錯誤：把 3a + 5 寫成 8a —— 3a 和 5 是不同類項，不可相加！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 第二高頻錯誤：混淆「a 的 3 倍加 5」（3a+5）和「a 加 5 的 3 倍」（3(a+5)）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 Worked Examples</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例1</td><td>用代數式表示：「比 n 多 8」和「m 的 4 倍少 3」。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例2</td><td>如果 p = 6，求代數式 2p + 3 的值。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 + KP3 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：簡易Equation — 天平原理（x + a = b, x − a = b）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>天平原理（等式的基本性質）：</strong><br/>
      ① 天平兩邊相等 → 等式兩邊同時做相同運算，等式仍然成立<br/>
      ② <strong>解 x + a = b</strong>：兩邊同時減 a → x = b − a<br/>
      ③ <strong>解 x − a = b</strong>：兩邊同時加 a → x = b + a<br/>
      ④ <strong>檢驗</strong>：把答案代入原Equation，左邊 = 右邊即為正確
    </div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">寫Equation</div><div class="d">把文字翻譯<br/>成等式</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">逆向運算</div><div class="d">加變減<br/>減變加</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">求 x</div><div class="d">計算出<br/>x 的值</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">驗算</div><div class="d">代入原式<br/>左=右？</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例3：解Equation x + 7 = 15（寫出步驟 + 驗算）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例4：解Equation x − 9 = 23（寫出步驟 + 驗算）</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習（必須寫出「兩邊同時 +/- 多少」的步驟）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>解Equation：x + 12 = 30</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>解Equation：x − 8 = 17</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>解Equation：25 + x = 41</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>解Equation：x − 15 = 9</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>解Equation：x + 4.5 = 10.2</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：簡易Equation — 乘除（ax = b, x ÷ a = b）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 進階</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>乘除Equation的逆向思維（T7 Trap重點）：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>解 ax = b</strong>：兩邊同時除以 a → x = b ÷ a<br/>
      ② <strong>解 x ÷ a = b</strong>：兩邊同時乘以 a → x = b × a<br/>
      ③ <strong>T7 Trap</strong>：很多學生在 x ÷ a = b 時錯誤地「除以 a」而不是「乘以 a」<br/>
      ④ <strong>記法</strong>：乘 → 用除解；除 → 用乘解（逆向操作！）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例5：解Equation 6x = 42</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例6：解Equation x ÷ 5 = 9</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 T7 Trap對比例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">解Equation：x ÷ 3 = 12</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ T7 Trap：逆向思維錯誤</div><div class="eq">x = 12 ÷ 3 = 4</div><div class="why">看到「÷3」就用「÷3」來解 → 大錯！等式兩邊應做相反運算</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確：逆向操作</div><div class="eq">x = 12 × 3 = 36</div><div class="why">x ÷ 3 = 12，兩邊同時 ×3：x = 12×3 = 36。驗算：36÷3=12 ✓</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點三 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>解Equation：8x = 56</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>解Equation：x ÷ 7 = 11</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: TIERED PRACTICE ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 5 題，All Must Complete）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>用代數式表示：「x 加 15」和「y 的 7 倍」。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>當 a = 10 時，求 a + 8 和 3a − 5 的值。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>解Equation：x + 9 = 21</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>解Equation：x − 6 = 14</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>解Equation：5x = 35</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 5 題，🚶🚀 Optional）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>解Equation：x + 2.8 = 9.6</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>解Equation：x ÷ 4 = 25</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>解Equation：4x = 100</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>如果 3n + 7 = 28，n 是多少？（提示：先找出 3n 的值）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>用代數式表示：「一個數的 5 倍減 8 等於 32」。然後解出這個數。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 5 題，🚀 Optional，呈分試殺手題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>解Equation：2x + 3x = 30（提示：先合併同類項）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>如果 x ÷ 3 + 5 = 12，求 x。（提示：分兩步——先處理 +5，再處理 ÷3）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>解Equation：<span class="f"><span class="n">x</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = 7（即 x ÷ 4 = 7，用Fraction形式表示）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>兩個連續數的和是 37。如果較小的數是 x。(a) 用代數式表示較大的數。(b) 列Equation求 x。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>Rectangle的長是闊的 2 倍。如果闊是 w cm。(a) 用代數式表示長。(b) 如果Perimeter是 36 cm，列Equation求 w。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 5: APPLICATION + CHALLENGE ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：列Equation解Word Problems（呈分試文字題專項）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>解題五步法（T3+T7 雙Trap防護）：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>設未知數</strong>：設 x 為要求的那個量（「設……」開頭）<br/>
      ② <strong>翻譯關係</strong>：將文字逐句翻譯成代數式（小心 T3！）<br/>
      ③ <strong>列Equation</strong>：根據等量關係寫出等式<br/>
      ④ <strong>解Equation</strong>：用逆向運算（小心 T7！）<br/>
      ⑤ <strong>驗算+答句</strong>：代入檢查 + 寫「答：……」
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例7：小明有一些貼紙，他給了妹妹 15 張後，還剩下 28 張。小明原有多少張貼紙？（設 x → 列Equation → 解 → 答）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例8：一盒糖果平均分給 6 人，每人得到 8 粒。這盒糖果共有多少粒？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Word Problems練習（全部必做，設 x → 列Equation → 解 → 答句）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td>小美有 x 元，她用了 35 元後，還剩 42 元。她原有多少元？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">29</td><td>一包米的重量是 n kg。5 包同樣的米共重 40 kg。求 n。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td>哥哥的年齡是弟弟的 3 倍。如果哥哥今年 27 歲，弟弟今年多少歲？（設弟弟 y 歲）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">31</td><td>一條繩子長 L cm，剪去 28 cm 後，餘下的是原來的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。求 L。（提示：餘下 = L − 28，同時餘下 = <span class="f"><span class="n">L</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">32</td><td>書架上有中文書和英文書。中文書比英文書多 12 本。如果英文書有 x 本，(a) 用代數式表示中文書數量。(b) 如果總共有 58 本書，求 x。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">33</td><td>一個Rectangle，長是闊的 3 倍。如果Perimeter是 64 cm，(a) 設闊為 w，用代數式表示長。(b) 用代數式表示Perimeter。(c) 列Equation求 w 和長。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、🏔️ 終極挑戰專區</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️1</td><td>三個連續數之和是 72。設最小的數為 n。(a) 用代數式表示三個數。(b) 列Equation求三個數各是多少。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️2</td><td>A 和 B 共有 $180。A 的金額是 B 的 2 倍。設 B 有 $x。(a) 列Equation。(b) 求 A 和 B 各有多少元。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️3</td><td>爸爸今年 40 歲，兒子今年 12 歲。多少年後，爸爸的年齡是兒子的 2 倍？（設 y 年後 → 40+y = 2(12+y)）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
