<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1001">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P5-1001</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Solve the equation: a + 10 = 20</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> a=30 (add 10 to both sides)
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> a=10
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3 Addition equation: a=20−10
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1002">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P5-1002</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Solve the equation: 30 − b = 15</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> b=30−15=15… Wait, b=15 is correct!
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> 30=15+b, b=30−15=15. b is the subtrahend, not the minuend
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3 Equation with unknown subtrahend: cannot directly subtract 30 from both sides (would give a negative number)
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1003">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P5-1003</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Solve the equation: 4y = 28</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> y=28+4=32
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> y=7
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3 Multiplication equation: y=28÷4
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1004">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P5-1004</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Solve the equation: c ÷ 6 = 12</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> c=12÷6=2
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> c=72
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3 Division equation: c=12×6
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1005">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
