                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P5-1005</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">Xiao Ming has $x. After buying a book for $35, he divides the remaining money equally among 4 younger brothers, each receiving $15. How much money did Xiao Ming originally have?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> 35+15=50
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> (x−35)÷4=15, x−35=60, x=95
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3+T7 Multi-step reasoning: set up equation, solve equation
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1006">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P5-1006</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">The perimeter of a rectangular playground is 92 meters, and the length is 30 meters. What is the width in meters?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> (92−30)÷2=31
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> Let width = y, (y+30)×2=92, y+30=46, y=16
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3+T7 Reverse perimeter formula
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1007">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
