                <div class="lf-trap-q">Sister's savings are 2 times Xiao Ming's savings plus 7 dollars. Sister has 77 dollars. How many dollars does Xiao Ming have?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> 77×2+7=161
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> Let Xiao Ming have y dollars, 2y+7=77, 2y=70, y=35
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3+T7 "7 dollars more" is added after 2 times, not before
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T3" data-hq-id="LF-T3-P5-1008">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T3</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐⭐ 🔴</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T3-P5-1008</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">A bag of red beans costs $55, a bag of soybeans costs $22. Buying the same number of each, the total cost is $385. How many bags of each were bought?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> 385÷(55+22)=385÷77=… Hey, this is correct =5
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> Let n be the number of bags, 55n+22n=385, 77n=385, n=5
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T3+T7 Combining like terms
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
